G1 for generic analytic DW (from T0d): M_eff/M is one constant at every r and every M
======================================================================================================================
    Phi'(r) = g_N(r) * (Fbar - 8 f1)/(Fbar (Fbar - 6 f1)) for the point mass and (1 - 2 f1/(Fbar - 6 f1))/Fbar * g_N for extended baryons: a pure rescaling of G.
